<title>USA: TCI sees more linkups like Falcon deal.</title>
<headline>TCI sees more linkups like Falcon deal.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele-Communications Inc President Leo Hindery said Thursday that he expects the cable giant to forge more partnerships like the deal announced Wednesday with Falcon Holding Group LP.</p>
<p>TCI will hold a minority interest in the Falcon partnership. Hindery characterized the stake as less than 50 percent but more than 30 percent. He declined to specify the exact amount.</p>
<p>Hindery said eventual partnership with other cable systems will likely affect some four million TCI subscribers eventually.</p>
